<title>MEXICO: Serfin issues Cydsa call options.</title>
<headline>Serfin issues Cydsa call options.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>OBSA, the brokerage arm of the Serfin financial group, announced on Wednesday a public offering of up to three million call options on Cydsa A series shares.</p>
<p>Each option is to buy one Cydsa series A share at 16.84 pesos, which may be exercised between January 15 and July 8. A premium cost of 2.78 pesos per option is payable on January 17. The issue is the first of a series of 12, OBSA said in a news statement.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
</text>
